// After the chart terminated, KIELER's simulation does not step its program any more: the condition `x < 10 / k`,
// which the netlist code computes in every tick, does not divide by zero when k becomes 0 (no crash), and _TERM stays
// set.
scchart ProbeTerminatedCondition {
  input int k
  output int x = 0

  initial state A
    if x < 10 / k go to B
  final state B
}
